gin="01:11.250" end="01:11.730">out</span><span begin="01:11.730" end="01:11.790">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.790" end="01:13.320"><span begin="01:11.790" end="01:12.000">I </span><span begin="01:12.000" end="01:12.270">will </span><span begin="01:12.270" end="01:12.690">redeem </span><span begin="01:12.690" end="01:13.320">myself</span><span begin="01:13.320" end="01:13.320">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.320" end="01:15.630"><span begin="01:13.320" end="01:13.530">My </span><span begin="01:13.530" end="01:13.800">heart </span><span begin="01:13.800" end="01:13.860">ache </span><span begin="01:13.860" end="01:13.920">it </span><span begin="01:13.920" end="01:14.190">can </span><span begin="01:14.190" end="01:14.640">rest </span><span begin="01:14.640" end="01:15.030">till </span><span begin="01:15.030" end="01:15.570">then</span><span begin="01:15.570" end="01:15.630">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.630" end="01:17.550"><span begin="01:15.630" end="01:16.410">Whoa</span><span begin="01:16.410" end="01:16.410">! </span><span begin="01:16.410" end="01:16.860">Whoa</span><span begin="01:16.860" end="01:16.860">! </span><span begin="01:16.860" end="01:17.520">I</span><span begin="01:17.520" end="01:17.550">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.550" end="01:24.090"><span begin="01:17.550" end="01:17.820">I </span><span begin="01:17.820" end="01:18.210">can't </span><span begin="01:18.210" end="01:19.140">wait </span><span begin="01:19.140" end="01:19.320">to </span><span begin="01:19.320" end="01:19.560">see </span><span begin="01:19.560" end="01:19.860">you </span><span begin="01:19.860" end="01:21.420">again</span><span begin="01:21.420" end="01:24.090">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.090" end="01:27.630"><span begin="01:24.090" end="01:24.540">I </span><span begin="01:24.540" end="01:25.020">got </span><span begin="01:25.020" end="01:25.350">this </span><span begin="01:25.350" end="01:26.010">crazy </span><span be